384
00:32:29,081 --> 00:32:31,416
Mira, todo se reduce a seguir una receta.

385
00:32:31,450 --> 00:32:34,085
Simple, complicado, no importa.

386
00:32:34,120 --> 00:32:36,521
Los pasos nunca cambian,

387
00:32:36,555 --> 00:32:39,624
