396
00:33:00,078 --> 00:33:02,079
¿Cómo lo resolverías?

397
00:33:03,115 --> 00:33:04,215
Gus.

398
00:33:05,751 --> 00:33:07,785
Si haces esto,

399
00:33:07,820 --> 00:33:09,820
