495
00:45:40,233 --> 00:45:42,167
Eso ha sido inteligente.

496
00:45:42,202 --> 00:45:43,970
Sí.

497
00:45:46,473 --> 00:45:47,473
Kenny Rogers.

498
00:45:53,746 --> 00:45:55,213
